# Live files

App folder = **code only**. Resolve via `scripts/app_paths.py` → `shared/paths.py`.

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `data/PurchaseOrder/Database.xlsx` | Product DB for slips |
| `data/PurchaseOrder/Packs Database.xlsx` | Packs |
| `data/PurchaseOrder/stock_levels_*.csv` | BTC free stock |
| `data/shipstation/ShipStation_Tags.xlsx` | Shared tags |
| `data/product_export/ProductExport.csv` | Shared PE |
| `Custom Label Database/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | Stock id fallback (`BTC SKU`) |
| `data/images/purchase_order/` | brand_logos / product_images |
| `runtime/PurchaseOrder/Output/` | Run outputs |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | ShipStation `REAL_API_*` |
| `config/PurchaseOrder/config.py` | FTP/stock settings (never commit) |
